{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the end of everything. Please gear up responsibly.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out of Time is a fast-paced, multi-player co-op roguelite where your squad, gear, and teamwork decide survival. Battle through a fractured world where past, present, and future collide - facing swarms of corrupted enemies, brutal bosses, and challenges all before time runs out.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gear-Defined Chaos</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/68c942aad9e3a860c000807a6d543d5d.poster.avif?t=1774390129\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/68c942aad9e3a860c000807a6d543d5d.webm?t=1774390129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Build your character around dozens of unique weapons and gear sets, each unlocking powerful abilities and benefits. Combine DPS firepower, supportive heals and buffs, or a healthy dose of Tank to create your own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Tethered Teamwork</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/176d5356b827a3bfb3e172b3699cf012.poster.avif?t=1774390129\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/176d5356b827a3bfb3e172b3699cf012.webm?t=1774390129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Stay close or suffer the consequences. The Tether System rewards proximity with shared buffs, healing, and stats - but break away and you risk not only yourself, but your entire team. Collaboration isn\u2019t optional - it\u2019s the core of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Take on the Timelines</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/461c1e5249f8d2fe34d7626ce58ff19c.poster.avif?t=1774390129\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/461c1e5249f8d2fe34d7626ce58ff19c.webm?t=1774390129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Battle through collapsing eras from the lush forest of Medieval, to the deserts of the Wasteland. Each run feels different thanks to era-blending maps, escalating enemies, and punishing boss fights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Fast-Paced Mayhem Loops</i></strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/484a9b6a6c2faff6a932355f89bce1f2.poster.avif?t=1774390129\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/484a9b6a6c2faff6a932355f89bce1f2.webm?t=1774390129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re on the clock. Each tight, action-packed run is a chaotic sprint full of intense combat and ridiculous boss fights. Win or wipe, you\u2019ll be back faster - stronger, smarter, and more determined than ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Temporal Anomalies</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/bf5eca245a94b9d2c28b3175f3cb3d70.poster.avif?t=1774390129\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/bf5eca245a94b9d2c28b3175f3cb3d70.webm?t=1774390129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/bf5eca245a94b9d2c28b3175f3cb3d70.mp4?t=1774390129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on Temporal Anomalies \u2014 chaotic modifiers that infect Shattered levels and twist the rules as they move across Eras. A Blood Moon accelerates enemies and tears through your health. A Toxic Cloud punishes you for standing still. Survive and reap unique rewards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>A World Beyond Time</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/3f37ce3d8c2745a3ac944bf951a0e78b.poster.avif?t=1774390129\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038140/extras/3f37ce3d8c2745a3ac944bf951a0e78b.webm?t=1774390129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up with other players in Infinitopia, mankind\u2019s new bastion and an MMO-like hub, to flex gear, find new friends, plan builds, and head out on your next run. Unlock new eras, and evolve your arsenal in a universe where survival fuels progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why You'll Love It</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D multiplayer roguelite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No locked roles: combine hundreds of gear pieces into millions of possible builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4-player co-op systems that reward teamwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience over-the-top abilities - from transforming into a mech to dropping airstrikes or deploying tesla towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new avatars and customize your look as you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporal Anomalies that provide new challenges\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living social hub where players from all over the world gather, flex their builds, and head out on their next run</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Medieval Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038140/8fe6fa47c3b357c2ec9d60f51a35849ddc24872e.jpg"},{"name":"Medieval Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038140/e794082b040cbaf27a8517fda05f8a6c296e48f5.jpg"},{"name":"Medieval Shattered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038140/890b435d0f018a166d33d89609922ec80289d8a3.jpg"},{"name":"Medieval Shattered 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038140/fdd7142e4e6b64690b7d2b13d21fbfa998ed49a0.jpg"},{"name":"Modern Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038140/a4fe58dd0e24a383b7429d5d3bbde6bfc6f3a434.jpg"},{"name":"Modern Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038140/a126ab1dd6e8ed72a1d7cc69f5a6a53ec932f831.jpg"},{"name":"Modern Shattered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038140/727cd1d3420a188f0a63d1737ba546b71653f049.jpg"},{"name":"Modern Shattered 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038140/914529d668d4db70645e544e10533d4e88531f48.jpg"},{"name":"Wasteland Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4038140/b3af77036018826ad7ba18393af350013a27a7f3.jpg"},{"name":"Wasteland Clea